          "id": "1768987530419",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768987530420_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your Job is to build a response for showing Vacant child positions under logged in user.\n\nPastIncumbentDetails : {{$context.$nodes.SHOWVACANTCHILDPOSITIONS.$output.result.PastIncumbentDetails}}\n\n-- Showing PastIncumbentDetails --\n* Must display as HTML table, the columns are Name, Code, Previous Person Number, Previous Person Name, Position Exit Date.\n* HTML table header row background : medium gray;\n* Output must be valid HTML only. Do not output Markdown. Do not output backticks. Do not output any plain text outside HTML tags.\n* Set the width of the PositionName and PositionCode columns to max-content, and ensure that the content in all rows of these columns does not wrap.\n* Do not show vacant child position table after user has disagreed to reuse vacant child position.\n* Do not show vacant child position table during create flow.\n* Do not show vacant child position table when providing deeplink urls.\n* Show table descriptions as \"Vacant Child Positions under your Position and their Previous Incumbents\". and suggest would you like to reuse instead of create.\n\nBelow the table mention exactly without rephrasing : \n\"Please clearly state how you would like to proceed. If you would like to continue creating a new position, state that explicitly. If you would like to alter or reuse an existing vacant child position, include the position name from the table above and describe the operation you would like to perform.\""
            }
