            {
              "id": "1768988032467_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Present the following failure details to the user in a clear and summarized format, highlighting the most important information:\n\n**FailureDetail : {{$context.$nodes.EVALUATEFAILURE.$output.result}}.\n\nWorkflow Name: Extract WorkflowName from FailureDetail and show.\nNode Name: Extract NodeName from FailureDetail and show.\nError Message: Extract ErrorMessage from FailureDetail and show.\nPayload Valid: Extract IsValid from FailureDetail and show.\nError Available: Extract IsErrorAvailable from FailureDetail and show.\n\nEnsure that the message is easy to read, with a focus on the workflow name, node name, and error message. The status of the payload and error availability should also be presented clearly.\n\n\n--- Response formatting Guidelines ---\n- Write clearly and professionally; use correct grammar, full stops, and active voice.\n- Keep responses brief and transactional; avoid long paragraphs.\n- Use short paragraphs or single sentences as needed.\n- Add concise headings only when they improve clarity.\n- Use bullet points or numbered steps for tasks, options, or key data.\n- Maintain consistent punctuation and spacing with a blank line between sections.\n- Keep tone neutral and direct; avoid filler and repetition.\n- Focus strictly on the requested content; do not add conclusions, next steps, or extra sections."
            }
